{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>חנו</b> — twice in the Masorah: חנו מחוץ למחנה, חנו עליה סביב. Meaning: even though it says חנו מחוץ למחנה, <b>חנו עליה סביב</b> — that is, in the camp of Leviyah, as written: והלוים יחנו סביב למשכן העדות — one impure through corpse-contact is permitted to enter the camp of Leviyah."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:23:32.460199223Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}